  "headline": "NasDem and PAN Support Sugiono for Vice President Nomination",
  "seoTitle": "Sufmi Dasco Denies Vice President Bid",
  "metaDescription": "NasDem and PAN have announced support for Sugiono to serve as vice president, following outreach from Gerindra to secure multi-party backing.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Parties including NasDem and PAN have officially declared their support for Sugiono as the candidate for vice president.",
    "The Gerindra party is actively coordinating with various parliamentary factions to secure broad support for the nomination.",
    "Sugiono was observed arriving at the hospital for medical testing, a procedure associated with the selection process for the vice presidency."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The political landscape is shifting as multiple factions coalesce around the nomination of Sugiono for the office of vice president. Following outreach from the Gerindra party, which has been seeking cross-party consensus, the NasDem party confirmed its support citing directives from its leadership. Similarly, the National Mandate Party (PAN) has indicated its approval of the candidate, describing him as ideologically aligned with President Prabowo Subianto's vision and work style. The process involves coordination with other political groups, including Golkar, PKS, and PKB, to establish unified support. Ahead of the formal selection, candidates have begun undergoing necessary medical examinations at the Gatot Soebroto Army Hospital (RSPAD). These developments occur as political entities assess the remaining term of the 2024-2029 administration, emphasizing the need for cooperation among parliamentary factions during the selection of the successor.",
